  "reviewer_note": "Attributed casualty claims (Iranica): Herat 1,600,000 (Sayfi) to 2,400,000 (Juzjani); Marv over 1,300,000 (Jovayni); Nishapur 1,747,000 (Sayfi); Iranica says these cannot be taken literally. No path animation: dates for Otrar, Samarkand, Urgench and Merv were not confirmed on opened pages. Iranica dates the Otrar caravan killing to 1218, so 1219 is the invasion, not the pretext. Samarkand fall date not confirmed; not claimed.",
